{
  "$Comment": "The Sawmiller's Hatchet, the sawmill's drop-only trophy tool: a masterwork copy of the vanilla Mithril hatchet, upgraded to Legendary quality, MaxDurability 500 (the original carries 400), and a Woods gather power of 0.55 (the original's 0.5, the highest any vanilla hatchet reaches). Every other field is copied from the vanilla Mithril/Crude hatchet chain verbatim so the tool swings, sounds and repairs exactly like its forge sibling. Deliberately authored STANDALONE with no Parent and no Recipe: a Parent off the vanilla Mithril hatchet would inherit its crafting recipe and make the trophy forgeable, and this item exists only as the sawmill's deep-session find (Drops/RPG_Station_Sawmill_Trophy, referenced from Lootables/SawmillFinds). Tags.Family Hatchet is authored explicitly (vanilla gathering tools do not carry a Family tag yet), so the station's tag gate route recognizes it beside the functional Woods gather route.",
